# Bit Manipulation Toolkit in C

A C project demonstrating bitwise operations on 32-bit unsigned integers.

### Functions

- `set_bit()` — Sets a bit to 1.
- `clear_bit()` — Clears a bit to 0.
- `toggle_bit()` — Toggles a bit.
- `check_bit()` — Checks whether a bit is set.
- `count_set_bits()` — Counts the set bits.
- `is_power_of_two()` — Checks whether a number is a power of two.

Includes `print_binary()` to display numbers in binary format.